  "description": "Discontinued, replaced by the current BFe (Gen7), which adds a mullet wheel setup option. This page is kept as an archive record for owners and for anyone researching an older Cotic BFe.\n\nYears of production: 2020-2024\n\nThis is the 6th generation BFe, and the last 27.5\" BFe. It launched in 2020 and was updated in 2023 with a lower bottom bracket, a steeper seat angle and more bottle bosses. See the BFe archive, and the current BFe.\n\nThe Cotic BFe: trail, DH, slalom, park. It does it all.\n\nThe BFe is our trail bashing, downhill thrashing, jump park smashing, enduro winning, do-it-all fun machine.\n\nFinishes for 2020: Gloss Black X and Y, Dark Grey and Sunny Yellow.",
